  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Promoting Rule of Law in Palestine (Sawasya II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sawasya II (Promoting Rule of Law in the State of Palestine) is a joint programme that advances human rights, rule of law, gender justice, and access to justice for women and children in Palestine. Its integrated programmatic framework contributes to priority areas in line with 2030 Agenda and Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) targets, and the National Policy Agenda for the State of Palestine</narrative>
  </description>
